---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../data/site';
import { getLegalDocument } from '../content/read';

const breadcrumbs = [{ name: 'Terms of use', path: '/terms/' }];
const mailto = `mailto:${siteConfig.contactEmail}?subject=Website%20terms`;
const legalDocument = await getLegalDocument('terms');
if (!legalDocument) throw new Error('Terms content is missing.');
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`${legalDocument.title} — working version`}
  description={legalDocument.description}
  noindex={legalDocument.status !== 'approved'}
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
>
  <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Terms of use' }]} />
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Website terms"
    title={legalDocument.title}
    intro="These working terms explain the rules for using the Impact Sol. information website and enquiry routes. They are prepared for Bangladesh and remain subject to qualified legal review."
    compact
  />

  <div class="shell legal-status" role="note" aria-label="Document status">
    <strong>Status: {legalDocument.status.replace('-', ' ')}</strong>
    <span>Last reviewed {legalDocument.lastReviewed}. Bangladesh governing-law wording is included; qualified legal approval and a publishable business address remain outstanding.</span>
  </div>

  <div class="shell legal-layout">
    <aside aria-label="On this page">
      <p class="eyebrow">On this page</p>
      <nav>
        <a href="#about">About these terms</a>
        <a href="#site">Using this website</a>
        <a href="#enquiries">Enquiries and relationships</a>
        <a href="#content">Content and claims</a>
        <a href="#rights">Intellectual property</a>
        <a href="#links">Third-party links</a>
        <a href="#liability">Responsibility and liability</a>
        <a href="#law">Governing law and disputes</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </aside>

    <article class="legal-copy">
      <section id="about" tabindex="-1">
        <h2>1. About these terms</h2>
        <p class="cms-summary">{legalDocument.body}</p>
        <p>Impact Sol. is a Bangladesh-based business operating under a DNCC trade licence. The licence number, business type and private address are not published on this website.</p>
        <p>By using this website, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please stop using the website. This is a working version published for transparency and must receive qualified legal review before it is marked approved.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="site" tabindex="-1">
        <h2>2. Using this website</h2>
        <p>You may use the public website for lawful, personal or organisational information purposes. You must not:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>attempt to gain unauthorised access to the site, server, database or another person’s information;</li>
          <li>interfere with security, availability, rate limits or form protections;</li>
          <li>submit malicious code, spam, unlawful content or misleading identity information;</li>
          <li>scrape or automate requests in a way that harms the service or other users; or</li>
          <li>present website content in a way that falsely implies endorsement, partnership or verified impact.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Access may be limited where reasonably necessary to protect the service, people, rights or legal obligations. Nothing in these terms authorises activity prohibited by applicable law.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="enquiries" tabindex="-1">
        <h2>3. Enquiries do not create a relationship</h2>
        <p>Submitting a general, partnership, maker or initiative enquiry does not create a contract, partnership, agency, funding commitment, selection decision, endorsement or right to use Chokro. Any future relationship would require separate written terms, appropriate review and agreement by authorised parties.</p>
        <p>Do not submit confidential material through a first-contact form. Unless a separate confidentiality agreement is signed, sending an enquiry should not be understood to create a duty to treat an unsolicited idea or business description as confidential.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="content" tabindex="-1">
        <h2>4. Informational content and product status</h2>
        <p>This site explains Impact Sol.’s intended direction while its wider operating model is being established. Plans and proposed relationships can change. Chokro is owned by Impact Sol. and is currently a working prototype. Its Google Play and Apple App Store launch is planned for 28 September 2026, but store review and final release checks may change that date.</p>
        <p>No material on this website is professional, legal, financial, environmental-certification or investment advice. No metric, forecast or environmental outcome should be inferred where none is explicitly published with its method and limitations.</p>
        <p>Impact Sol. aims to keep published information accurate but does not promise that every page will always be complete, current, uninterrupted or error-free. Confirm important information directly before relying on it.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="rights" tabindex="-1">
        <h2>5. Intellectual property and permitted reuse</h2>
        <p>Impact Sol. owns Chokro and the Chokro materials it has approved for publication. Other names, marks and third-party materials remain the property of their respective owners. No ownership of UN, SDG or 3ZERO names, marks or materials is claimed.</p>
        <p>You may link to public pages accurately without implying affiliation or endorsement. No licence is granted to reproduce Impact Sol. or Chokro marks, interface assets, software or substantial website content except with written permission or where applicable law permits it.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="links" tabindex="-1">
        <h2>6. Third-party links and services</h2>
        <p>A link to another website is provided for context and does not by itself mean that Impact Sol. controls, endorses or accepts responsibility for it. Third-party sites may have different terms, accessibility and privacy practices.</p>
        <p>Google Play, the Apple App Store and other external services apply their own terms, privacy practices and availability decisions. A verified external link will be labelled so visitors can understand when they are leaving this website.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="liability" tabindex="-1">
        <h2>7. Availability, responsibility and liability</h2>
        <p>The website may be updated, paused or withdrawn. Security and accessibility issues can be reported, but uninterrupted or error-free availability cannot be promised.</p>
        <p>To the extent permitted by Bangladesh law, Impact Sol. is not responsible for indirect or consequential loss caused solely by reliance on incomplete informational content, external services or temporary unavailability. Nothing in these terms excludes liability or a consumer, privacy or other statutory right that cannot lawfully be excluded.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>8. Privacy, accessibility and changes</h2>
        <p>Use of personal information is described in the <a href="/privacy/">privacy notice</a>. The site’s accessibility target and feedback route are described in the <a href="/accessibility/">accessibility statement</a>.</p>
        <p>Material changes will be identified by the reviewed date. Continued use after a published change means the updated terms apply from that date, subject to applicable law.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="law" tabindex="-1">
        <h2>9. Governing law and disputes</h2>
        <p>These terms are intended to be governed by the laws of Bangladesh. Please contact Impact Sol. first so a concern can be understood and addressed. If it cannot be resolved informally, it may be brought before a court or authority with lawful jurisdiction in Bangladesh. Mandatory consumer and privacy complaint rights remain unaffected.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="contact" tabindex="-1">
        <h2>10. Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about these terms can be sent to <a href={mailto}>{siteConfig.contactEmail}</a> or raised by calling <a href={`tel:${siteConfig.contactPhoneHref}`}>{siteConfig.contactPhoneDisplay}</a>. We aim to acknowledge messages within six hours, although a complete response may take longer.</p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-status {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-4);
    margin-top: var(--space-6);
    padding: var(--space-4);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-warning-line);
    color: var(--color-forest);
    background: var(--color-warning-surface);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  }

  .legal-status span { color: var(--color-muted); }

  .legal-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 16rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 7rem);
    padding-block: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 7rem);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .legal-layout > aside { position: sticky; top: 7rem; }
  .legal-layout nav { display: grid; margin-top: var(--space-3); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line); }
  .legal-layout nav a { display: flex; min-height: 44px; padding: 0.7rem 0; align-items: center; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-line); color: var(--color-forest); font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: var(--weight-semibold); }
  .legal-copy { max-width: 52rem; }
  .legal-copy section { padding-block: 0 2.5rem; scroll-margin-top: 7rem; }
  .legal-copy section + section { padding-top: 2.5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line); }
  .legal-copy h2 { font-size: var(--step-2); }
  .legal-copy p, .legal-copy li { color: var(--color-muted); }
  .legal-copy li + li { margin-top: 0.55rem; }

  @media (max-width: 50rem) {
    .legal-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .legal-layout > aside { position: static; }
    .legal-status { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
